  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Choose one next planning step using the local decision below. Return exactly one listed statement and stop. No other planning choices have been supplied.\n{\"context\": \"A plot may be unattended for a short period, and its usual gardeners can state what help is welcome.\", \"decision\": \"How should an unused shared plot receive temporary care?\", \"goal\": \"Keep routine garden work visible and shared without requiring everyone to attend at the same time.\", \"problem\": \"A small community garden has established beds, safe shared tools, a water supply, and volunteers whose availability varies. Gardening methods are already agreed; the new work is organizing participation, observations, and shared resources. Each decision below covers a distinct coordination need and can be combined with any choices at the other decisions.\"}\nCANDIDATE STATEMENTS:\nThe usual gardeners and temporary volunteers walk the plot together and record care assignments afterward. Assignments follow a shared view of the plot’s condition.\nOther volunteers offer temporary care tasks, and the usual gardeners confirm which offers to accept. Available help provides the starting point for an agreed arrangement.\nThe usual gardeners list welcome care tasks before other volunteers choose temporary assignments. Temporary help follows the gardeners’ stated needs."
    }
